WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.533
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.533 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.367 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.867
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.867 --> 00:49.367
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.867 --> 00:54.867
[lively string music]
[欢快的弦乐]

00:54.867 --> 01:00.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:01.867 --> 01:03.833
- Ahh! Sea spider!
- 啊！海蜘蛛！

01:03.833 --> 01:05.100
Sea spider! Sea spider!
海蜘蛛！海蜘蛛！

01:05.100 --> 01:06.867
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

01:06.867 --> 01:08.433
- Ahh!
- 啊！

01:09.500 --> 01:11.167
Oh!
哦！

01:14.267 --> 01:15.267
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:15.267 --> 01:17.367
- [hissing]
- Oh.
- [嘶嘶声]
- 哦。

01:17.367 --> 01:20.067
Back! Back!
后退！后退！

01:20.067 --> 01:21.467
Oh.
哦。

01:21.467 --> 01:24.800
Oh!
Oh. Ah!
哦！
哦。啊!

01:24.800 --> 01:26.767
[sobs]
[抽泣]

01:26.767 --> 01:28.767
[blowing]
[吹]

01:32.400 --> 01:34.933
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

01:38.500 --> 01:39.800
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:39.800 --> 01:42.067
Whoa!
哇！

01:42.067 --> 01:43.367
Oh, boy! Here it is!
哦，孩子！这里是！

01:43.367 --> 01:45.667
My lost coupon!
我丢失的优惠券！

01:45.667 --> 01:48.800
I found it!
我找到了！

01:48.800 --> 01:50.400
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:50.400 --> 01:51.733
[gong sounds]
[锣声]

01:51.733 --> 01:54.067
You have fought well today,
sea spider,
今天你打得很好
海蜘蛛,

01:54.067 --> 01:55.533
and now I must leave.
现在我必须离开了。

01:55.533 --> 01:58.600
For I am going to use
this coupon to get an ice cream
因为我要使用
这张优惠券可以得到一个冰淇淋

01:58.600 --> 02:02.100
for my bestest friend
in the whole ocean--
给我最好的朋友
在整个海洋里——

02:02.100 --> 02:04.067
um...
嗯...

02:04.067 --> 02:06.367
Sponge Knob Hair Pants!
海绵旋钮发裤！

02:08.567 --> 02:10.567
Hmm.
唔。

02:10.567 --> 02:12.800
Hmm!
唔！

02:12.800 --> 02:13.833
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

02:13.833 --> 02:15.067
Hey, Patrick.
- Gah, gah! Oh.
嘿，帕特里克。
- 嘎嘎！哦。

02:15.067 --> 02:16.067
- What you doin'?
- 你在做什么？

02:16.067 --> 02:17.700
- I got this here free coupon
- 我在这里得到了这个免费优惠券

02:17.700 --> 02:20.067
and I'm gonna get you
an ice cream.
我会得到你
一个冰淇淋。

02:20.067 --> 02:23.067
- That's nice of you, buddy,
but I already got an ice cream.
- 你真好，伙计，
但我已经拿到了冰淇淋。

02:23.067 --> 02:24.233
- Uh...
- 呃...

02:24.233 --> 02:27.433
but I'm getting you
an ice cream!
但我明白你了
一个冰淇淋！

02:27.433 --> 02:29.200
- Why would ya?
I already got one.
- 为什么会这样？
我已经得到了一个。

02:29.200 --> 02:30.267
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:30.267 --> 02:33.633
Because I'm a nice guy!
因为我是个好人！

02:33.633 --> 02:36.700
- Wow.
There goes the nicest guy.
- 哇。
最好的人走了。

02:40.933 --> 02:42.600
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:45.600 --> 02:47.400
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:47.400 --> 02:48.533
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

02:48.533 --> 02:50.933
I win a free coupon!
我赢得了一张免费优惠券！

02:50.933 --> 02:54.133
- H-how did you know
about my free coupon?
- 你-你怎么知道
关于我的免费优惠券？

02:54.133 --> 02:55.900
- Me back knows.
- 我回来就知道了。

02:55.900 --> 02:59.067
It breaks out in hives
around anything free.
它爆发出荨麻疹
围绕任何免费的东西。

02:59.067 --> 03:00.233
- Guh.
- 呃。

03:00.233 --> 03:02.067
- I also know how heavy
- 我也知道有多重

03:02.067 --> 03:03.867
a free ice cream coupon can be.
一张免费的冰淇淋券即可。

03:03.867 --> 03:06.333
- It's heavy?
- 很重吗？

03:06.333 --> 03:08.600
[straining]
[紧张]

03:08.600 --> 03:12.367
- Much too much responsibility
for a carefree fellow like you.
- 太多的责任
对于像你这样无忧无虑的人来说。

03:12.367 --> 03:13.367
- [strains]
- [菌株]

03:13.367 --> 03:14.767
- Tell you what.
- 告诉你什么。

03:14.767 --> 03:16.567
I'll take that free coupon
off your hands
我要拿那张免费优惠券
离开你的手

03:16.567 --> 03:18.933
for the price
of a hearty handshake.
对于价格
的一次热烈的握手。

03:18.933 --> 03:20.867
- Uh...
- 呃...

03:20.867 --> 03:21.867
Oh.
哦。

03:21.867 --> 03:23.333
Ohh!
哦！

03:23.333 --> 03:25.800
Oh!
哦！

03:25.800 --> 03:28.733
SpongeBob does love handshakes.
海绵宝宝确实喜欢握手。

03:28.733 --> 03:31.333
- You should be ashamed
of yourself!
- 你应该感到羞耻
你自己！

03:31.333 --> 03:34.533
Taking advantage of a simpleton.
利用一个傻瓜的优势。

03:34.533 --> 03:36.100
- Ahh, come on.
- 啊，来吧。

03:36.100 --> 03:39.233
Can't an old crab have a little
unscrupulous fun anymore?
老蟹就不能吃点吗
不再肆无忌惮的玩耍了吗？

03:39.233 --> 03:40.767
- Hey, you ruined my deal!
- 嘿，你毁了我的交易！

03:40.767 --> 03:43.067
I almost had a handshake!
我差点就握手了！

03:43.067 --> 03:45.400
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:45.400 --> 03:47.767
- Oh, you dingdong
wing nut!
-哦，你叮咚
翼形螺母！

03:47.767 --> 03:50.233
Krabs was just trying
to steal your coupon!
蟹老板只是在尝试
窃取你的优惠券！

03:50.233 --> 03:52.667
- Steal my coupon?
- 偷了我的优惠券？

03:52.667 --> 03:53.733
Hmm.
唔。

03:53.733 --> 03:55.933
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:55.933 --> 03:58.700
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

03:58.700 --> 04:00.267
- You want my ice cream coupon!
- 你想要我的冰淇淋优惠券！

04:00.267 --> 04:01.267
You can't have it!
你不能拥有它！

04:01.267 --> 04:03.200
- Okay. Whatever.
- 好的。任何。

04:03.200 --> 04:05.467
- He never really knew
how to sing.
- 他从来没有真正知道过
如何唱歌。

04:05.467 --> 04:07.300
- No! Singers?
- 不！歌手？

04:07.300 --> 04:08.600
- You.
both: Hmm?
- 你。
两人：嗯？

04:08.600 --> 04:10.300
- Oh, I see you...
- 哦，我看到你了...

04:10.300 --> 04:12.767
peeking at my coupon!
偷看我的优惠券！

04:12.767 --> 04:14.500
It's for SpongeBob's
ice cream!
这是给海绵宝宝的
冰淇淋！

04:14.500 --> 04:16.867
- Hooray for SpongeBob.
- 海绵宝宝万岁。

04:16.867 --> 04:18.433
- Hey, what's going on?
[indistinct chatter]
- 嘿，怎么了？
[模糊的喋喋不休]

04:18.433 --> 04:20.167
- Get away from me!
All of you!
- 离我远点！
你们所有人！

04:20.167 --> 04:23.467
You're all after my coupon!
你们都在追求我的优惠券！

04:23.467 --> 04:24.733
[quavering]
[颤抖]

04:24.733 --> 04:30.300
all: Coupon! Coupon!
Coupon! Coupon!
全体：优惠券！优惠券！
优惠券！优惠券！

04:30.300 --> 04:35.500
Coupon! Coupon! Coupon!
Coupon!
优惠券！优惠券！优惠券！
优惠券！

04:35.500 --> 04:37.833
- No! You can't have my coupon!
- 不！你拿不到我的优惠券！

04:37.833 --> 04:40.067
No! No!
不！不！

04:40.067 --> 04:42.100
[static buzzes]
- Officer Slugfish?
[静态嗡嗡声]
- 蛞蝓警官？

04:42.100 --> 04:45.300
We got a call about a sea star
disturbance on your beat.
我们接到一个关于海星的电话
干扰你的节拍。

04:45.300 --> 04:46.300
Please investigate.
请调查。

04:46.300 --> 04:48.067
- Roger, headquarters.
- 罗杰，总部。

04:48.067 --> 04:49.067
Hey, you.
嘿，你。

04:51.767 --> 04:53.900
Headquarters?
I couldn't catch him.
总部？
我没能抓住他。

04:53.900 --> 04:56.067
He got away.
他逃走了。

04:56.067 --> 04:57.833
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

05:00.167 --> 05:02.167
- You're a bad baby!
- 你是个坏孩子！

05:02.167 --> 05:04.233
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:04.233 --> 05:08.200
Whaa!
哇！

05:08.200 --> 05:11.600
[shutters clicking]
[快门咔哒声]

05:11.600 --> 05:13.133
- Oh, look, honey,
- 哦，看，亲爱的，

05:13.133 --> 05:16.200
it's Bikini Bottom's
Sidewalk of the Stars.
这是比基尼泳裤的
星星的人行道。

05:16.200 --> 05:17.533
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:18.667 --> 05:20.700
- This one's gruesome.
- 这个太可怕了

05:20.700 --> 05:22.800
Hmm, looks like
some kids' cartoon.
嗯，看起来像
一些儿童卡通片。

05:22.800 --> 05:24.167
Should we take a photo?
我们应该拍张照片吗？

05:24.167 --> 05:27.867
- Nah, waste of film.
- 不，浪费胶卷。

05:27.867 --> 05:28.900
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:28.900 --> 05:29.700
Ooh.
哦。

05:29.700 --> 05:32.333
Ah! Come back!
啊!回来！

05:32.333 --> 05:35.100
Ah!
啊!

05:35.100 --> 05:36.200
I made it.
我做到了。

05:36.200 --> 05:39.067
[laughing]
[笑]

05:39.067 --> 05:40.800
It's beautiful.
很美丽。

05:40.800 --> 05:44.067
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

05:44.067 --> 05:46.800
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:46.800 --> 05:48.967
- And a good ice cream day
to you, sir.
- 美好的冰淇淋日
给你，先生。

05:48.967 --> 05:52.467
- Yes, it's a good day
for ice cream!
- 是的，这是美好的一天
为了冰淇淋！

05:52.467 --> 05:54.667
- And what's your pleasure?
- 你有什么高兴的事吗？

05:54.667 --> 05:57.733
- Oh, I want your bestest
ice cream
- 哦，我想要你最好的
冰淇淋

05:57.733 --> 06:01.167
for my bestest buddy, SpongeBob!
为了我最好的朋友海绵宝宝！

06:01.167 --> 06:02.433
- Excellent choice, sir.
- 很棒的选择，先生。

06:02.433 --> 06:05.667
One Heavenly Paradise coming up.
[cow mooing]
一个天堂即将来临。
[牛哞哞]

06:05.667 --> 06:09.133
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

06:09.133 --> 06:12.700
[horns blow]
[号角吹响]

06:12.700 --> 06:15.300
[Patrick moaning excitedly]
[帕特里克兴奋地呻吟]

06:15.300 --> 06:20.200
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:20.200 --> 06:24.467
- SpongeBob won't mind
if I just take a little taste.
- 海绵宝宝不会介意
如果我稍微尝尝。

06:24.467 --> 06:25.900
[buzzer sounds]
[蜂鸣器响]

06:25.900 --> 06:27.800
- Aw, this coupon's out of date.
- 噢，这张优惠券已经过时了。

06:27.800 --> 06:29.367
Expired two years ago.
两年前就过期了。

06:29.367 --> 06:32.400
Sorry, we can't honor it.
抱歉，我们无法兑现。

06:32.400 --> 06:35.067
- No ice cream for SpongeBob?
- 海绵宝宝没有冰淇淋吗？

06:35.067 --> 06:35.833
Uh!
呃！

06:35.833 --> 06:38.967
[grunting loudly]
[大声咕哝]

06:43.067 --> 06:47.700
I demand that you honor
my coupon!
我要求你尊重
我的优惠券！

06:47.700 --> 06:49.867
[sobbing loudly]
[大声抽泣]

06:49.867 --> 06:52.167
- Temper tantrum
in center aisle!
- 发脾气
在中央过道！

06:52.167 --> 06:54.433
- I'm on it.
- 我正在做。

06:54.433 --> 06:56.600
- Take my coupon!
- 拿走我的优惠券！

06:56.600 --> 06:57.667
Take my coupon.
拿我的优惠券。

06:57.667 --> 07:00.533
Take my coupon. Take my coupon.
拿我的优惠券。拿我的优惠券。

07:00.533 --> 07:01.767
Ah, take my--
啊，带上我的——

07:01.767 --> 07:04.667
- You poor, miserable creature.
- 你这个可怜的、悲惨的生物。

07:04.667 --> 07:07.067
- I'm miserable.
- 我很痛苦。

07:07.067 --> 07:09.100
- You wretched, worthless,
shabby--
- 你这个可怜的、毫无价值的人，
破旧——

07:09.100 --> 07:12.267
- Hey, don't you think
you're being a little harsh?
- 嘿，你不觉得吗
你是不是有点严厉了？

07:12.267 --> 07:13.500
- Not really.
- 并不真地。

07:13.500 --> 07:14.767
Look at him.
看看他。

07:14.767 --> 07:16.567
- [Patrick groans]
- [帕特里克呻吟]

07:16.567 --> 07:17.967
- Yeah. Never mind.
- 是的。没关系。

07:17.967 --> 07:20.067
Continue and bump it up
a little bit.
继续并提高它
一点点。

07:23.100 --> 07:24.467
- Listen, buddy,
- 听着，伙计，

07:24.467 --> 07:27.567
there is one person
who can honor this coupon;
有一个人
谁可以兑现这张优惠券；

07:27.567 --> 07:29.767
the person who owns this store.
拥有这家商店的人。

07:29.767 --> 07:33.333
The Ice Cream King himself.
冰淇淋大王本人。

07:33.333 --> 07:35.400
- The Ice Cream King?
- 冰淇淋大王？

07:35.400 --> 07:36.567
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

07:36.567 --> 07:38.267
He lives up there
in that mansion.
他住在上面
在那栋豪宅里。

07:38.267 --> 07:39.700
- Wow.
- 哇。

07:39.700 --> 07:41.067
- Do you need a push?
- 你需要推吗？

07:41.067 --> 07:44.100
- Yeah.
Would you, please?
- 是的。
请问你愿意吗？

07:46.867 --> 07:48.300
Whoa.
哇哦。

07:48.300 --> 07:51.233
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:51.233 --> 07:52.600
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:52.600 --> 07:54.167
Hello?
你好？

07:54.167 --> 07:57.333
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:57.333 --> 07:59.633
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

07:59.633 --> 08:01.567
- Are you the exterminator?
- 你是灭虫者吗？

08:01.567 --> 08:03.333
- Oh. [laughs]
No.
- 哦。 [笑]
不。

08:03.333 --> 08:05.200
I'm not the extra gator.
我不是多余的鳄鱼。

08:05.200 --> 08:09.067
I'm here to redeem my coupon
for a free ice cream!
我是来兑换我的优惠券的
免费冰淇淋！

08:09.067 --> 08:12.067
It's for my bestest friend,
but it's out of date.
是为了我最好的朋友
但它已经过时了。

08:12.067 --> 08:14.333
- They're all out of date
because I don't know
- 它们都已经过时了
因为我不知道

08:14.333 --> 08:15.533
what year it is.
现在是哪一年。

08:15.533 --> 08:18.400
- I don't know
what anything is.
- 我不知道
什么东西是什么。

08:20.067 --> 08:23.800
- Are you smart or dumb?
- 你是聪明还是笨？

08:23.800 --> 08:25.300
- Apples?
- 苹果？

08:25.300 --> 08:26.900
- Genius!
- 天才！

08:26.900 --> 08:29.467
Let's see your head.
让我们看看你的头。

08:29.467 --> 08:31.900
I can't feel your brain.
我感觉不到你的大脑。

08:31.900 --> 08:34.100
- It's down here today.
- 今天就在这里。

08:34.100 --> 08:36.433
- Mine too!
- 我的也是！

08:36.433 --> 08:37.500
High five!
高五！

08:37.500 --> 08:38.500
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

08:38.500 --> 08:40.367
Secret handshake?
秘密握手？

08:40.367 --> 08:43.300
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:47.667 --> 08:48.967
Perfect!
完美的！

08:48.967 --> 08:52.067
You don't know
the secret handshake either.
你不知道
秘密握手也是如此。

08:52.067 --> 08:54.433
Hey, I don't know your name.
嘿，我不知道你的名字。

08:54.433 --> 08:55.433
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:55.433 --> 08:56.433
- Hey, you're right!
- 嘿，你说得对！

08:56.433 --> 08:58.233
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:58.233 --> 09:03.367
- This may still be redeemable
according to the fine print.
- 这可能仍然可以兑换
根据细则。

09:03.367 --> 09:05.967
- [straining]
- [紧张]

09:05.967 --> 09:08.633
I didn't bring my reading eyes.
我没有带读书的眼睛。

09:08.633 --> 09:10.767
- Try my glasses!
- 试试我的眼镜！

09:10.767 --> 09:11.900
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:11.900 --> 09:13.967
- Oh, ooh.
- 哦，哦。

09:13.967 --> 09:16.833
It says "garbaldy goop."
上面写着“garbaldy goop”。

09:16.833 --> 09:19.733
- But spelled backwards is...
- 但倒过来拼写是...

09:21.733 --> 09:24.067
The King's Challenge!
王者的挑战！

09:25.367 --> 09:27.900
Hair growing contest!
植发比赛！

09:27.900 --> 09:31.067
[straining]
[紧张]

09:33.833 --> 09:35.533
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

09:35.533 --> 09:36.800
- Wow.
- 哇。

09:36.800 --> 09:38.367
Oh...
哦...

09:38.367 --> 09:41.300
[straining]
[紧张]

09:44.733 --> 09:46.233
Ow.
噢。

09:46.233 --> 09:47.333
- That's sad.
- 太伤心了。

09:47.333 --> 09:49.100
Watch this.
注意这个。

09:49.100 --> 09:52.067
[straining]
[紧张]

09:55.700 --> 09:57.633
Try beating that.
尝试打败它。

09:57.633 --> 09:59.767
- Oh, man.
- 哦，伙计。

09:59.767 --> 10:02.900
[straining]
[紧张]

10:08.500 --> 10:10.700
- Ha ha!
I beat you.
- 哈哈！
我打败了你。

10:10.700 --> 10:13.400
- Not so fast.
- 没那么快。

10:13.400 --> 10:14.500
Ha!
哈!

10:14.500 --> 10:17.733
Can I redeem my coupon now?
我现在可以兑换优惠券吗？

10:17.733 --> 10:20.500
- Not just yet.
- 还没有。

10:20.500 --> 10:21.733
Best two out of three.
三分之二最好。

10:21.733 --> 10:23.767
[Eastern wind instruments]
[东风乐器]

10:23.767 --> 10:24.800
[gong sounds]
[锣声]

10:24.800 --> 10:26.300
- Ooh.
- Ooh.
- 哦。
- 哦。

10:27.567 --> 10:30.433
Your butterscotch style
is strong, Low Fat,
你的奶油糖果风格
强健、低脂、

10:30.433 --> 10:33.300
but it is no match
for my brownie bits!
但它不匹配
为了我的布朗尼块！

10:33.300 --> 10:34.300
- Ha, ha, ha!
- 哈哈哈！

10:34.300 --> 10:36.167
You'll wish your cone was a cup
你会希望你的圆锥体是一个杯子

10:36.167 --> 10:38.467
when I whip you into cream!
当我把你打成奶油的时候！

10:38.467 --> 10:39.567
Hi-ya!
嗨呀！

10:39.567 --> 10:41.600
[shouts]
[喊叫]

10:41.600 --> 10:44.733
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

10:48.200 --> 10:51.133
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

10:52.767 --> 10:54.933
They told me you had scoops,
他们告诉我你有独家新闻

10:54.933 --> 10:56.967
but your serve is soft.
但你的发球很软。

10:56.967 --> 10:59.567
I see you've studied
the ancient art of failure!
我看你已经学习了
古老的失败艺术！

10:59.567 --> 11:00.633
- Oh!
- 哦！

11:00.633 --> 11:03.367
- Redeem my coupon!
- 兑换我的优惠券！

11:03.367 --> 11:04.500
- Think fast--
- 快点思考--

11:04.500 --> 11:07.500
rainbow sprinkles!
彩虹洒落！

11:07.500 --> 11:08.733
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

11:08.733 --> 11:10.700
- You have played with skill
- 你玩得很有技巧

11:10.700 --> 11:11.700
and courage.
和勇气。

11:11.700 --> 11:13.800
I will honor your coupon.
我会尊重你的优惠券。

11:13.800 --> 11:16.933
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

11:18.567 --> 11:21.800
- One free ice cream cone!
- 一份免费蛋卷冰淇淋！

11:24.233 --> 11:27.400
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

11:27.400 --> 11:29.433
- Oh, hello, Patrick.
What's up?
- 哦，你好，帕特里克。
这是怎么回事？

11:29.433 --> 11:32.267
- I was gonna give you
this ice cream,
- 我本来想给你
这个冰淇淋，

11:32.267 --> 11:33.533
but it melted.
但它融化了。

11:33.533 --> 11:36.733
Instead, I got you
this hearty handshake.
相反，我得到了你
这一次衷心的握手

11:36.733 --> 11:38.400
- Aw, I love
hearty handshakes,
- 噢，我爱
亲切的握手，

11:38.400 --> 11:41.267
but not as much
as I love ice cream!
但没有那么多
因为我喜欢冰淇淋！

11:41.267 --> 11:43.533
[angelic choir harmonizes]
[天使合唱团的和谐]

11:43.533 --> 11:45.600
Care to join me?
愿意加入我吗？

11:45.600 --> 11:47.067
both: Whoo-hoo!
两人：呼呼！

两人：呼呼！